# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` may upload to Cloud Build (rebuild Phase 0).
# This is an ALLOW-LIST: everything is ignored, then only the engine's files are
# admitted. The repo is public and this folder also holds clinical documents
# (Input_files/), live credentials (.streamlit/), the datastore (*.db) and the
# owner's .env; none of them may leave the PC (CLAUDE.md, rebuild rule 7).
# Check the result with `gcloud meta list-files-for-upload .` before a deploy;
# scripts/rebuild_gate.py counts any personal file in that list as open.
# Add a file here only when the image needs it, and say why.

/*
!/.gcloudignore
!/Dockerfile
!/.dockerignore
!/requirements-engine.txt
!/api/
!/services/
!/training_plan.py
!/training_constants.py
!/cluster_a_battery.py
!/cluster_a_mechanics.py
!/cluster_a_prescription.py
!/flexibility_baselines.py
!/goal_block.py

# Never, even inside an admitted folder.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env*
**/.sync_state.json
